{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"##Visualizing the area\n\nWe sketch the graphs of $f$ and $g$ first.\n\n![graph](web+graphie:${☣ LOCALPATH}/images/199e9566536ea0bda6b2f2be7090a1ecdb461935)\n\nFrom the graph, it appears that $g(x)\\ge f(x)$ between $x=1$ and $x=5$ . From this we are looking to evaluate:\n\n$\\displaystyle \\int_{1}^{5}\\left( g(x)-f(x) \\right)\\,dx$","images":{"web+graphie:${☣ LOCALPATH}/images/199e9566536ea0bda6b2f2be7090a1ecdb461935":{"height":195,"width":195}},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"##Evaluating the definite integral\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle \\int_{1}^{5} \\left( \\dfrac{25}{x^2}+x - (x+1) \\right) \\,dx\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026= \\displaystyle \\int_{1}^{5} \\left( \\dfrac{25}{x^2}-1 \\right) \\,dx\\\\\\\\\n\u0026= -\\dfrac{25}{x}-x~\\Bigg|_{1}^{5} \\\\\\\\\n\u0026= \\left( -5-5  \\right) -\\left( -25-1 \\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026= 16\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"##Answer\n\nThe area is $16$ square units.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**What is the area of the region between the graphs of $f(x)=x+1$ and $g(x)=\\dfrac{25}{x^2}+x$ from $x=1$ to $x=5$ ?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"You may have distributed incompletely.","content":"$25$","correct":false},{"content":"$16$","correct":true},{"clue":"The power in $g$ is $-2$, not $2$.","content":"$\\dfrac{184}{15}$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"The power in $g$ is $-2$, not $2$.","content":"$\\dfrac{392}{5}$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"onePerLine":false,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
